ts/a-79542656--d9ec9cc932b7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hundreds-of-french-schools-shut-teen-loses-hand-in-protests/a-79542656?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The student protests that rocked France last week have prompted authorities to keep up to 500 schools closed on Monday. A teenage boy lost his hand, seemingly while trying to pick up a police tear gas grenade.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nationalists top Bosnia-Herzegovina's divisive election</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f4c6f0feed8861451723d211318c72ffac84b4f3af4bb708a2d6f22dab98c646</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T22:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nationalists-top-bosnia-herzegovina-s-divisive-election/a-79535336--ff55c4d27908.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nationalists-top-bosnia-herzegovina-s-divisive-election/a-79535336?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bosnia-Herzegovina's three-member presidency is set to be dominated by nationalists from the three major ethnic groups, including Zeljka ​Cvijanovic, backed by disqualified Serb secessionist leader Milorad Dodik.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UK remands 2 Iranians over alleged antisemitic terror plot</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:17b9886cda6b72becd7924e7a9de2645ee3f7847246c9ac0c5e155f04c71a83e</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T16:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-remands-2-iranians-over-alleged-antisemitic-terror-plot/a-79532184--b38b3689556f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-remands-2-iranians-over-alleged-antisemitic-terror-plot/a-79532184?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The pair were arrested on the eve of Yom Kippur and later charged with plotting to attack Jewish targets in Manchester.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Bosnia and Herzegovina is still shaped by war, separatism, EU ambitions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0ec0cdce27cfbc6441dc03778cd575ecda077fb67ae1ba4ffed264d97273e2a5</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T06:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bosnia-and-herzegovina-is-still-shaped-by-war-separatism-eu-ambitions/a-79523557--c6b59bb6d492.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bosnia-and-herzegovina-is-still-shaped-by-war-separatism-eu-ambitions/a-79523557?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bosnia and Herzegovina is governed by a system established after the Bosnian war — more than 30 years ago. Ethnic divisions, a complex administration and European integration all shape the country's political reality.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>German reunification: How inequality is shaping a new East German identity</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c3b6e32de8110ad42ba4699fc4e6983cd002f886d8624652f3a573dbebec18e4</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T04:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-reunification-how-inequality-is-shaping-a-new-east-german-identity/a-79518541--28106a765624.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-reunification-how-inequality-is-shaping-a-new-east-german-identity/a-79518541?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A new study highlights persistent structural disparities in wealth and leadership positions between East and West Germany, 36 years after reunification.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Spain's parliament rejects housing bill as protests continue</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7fe5e9839c2b87c9cb5d044f5c00dc1ca69214bb5a5ef5f25b445457cff6b2d2</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>20