dent of ice hockey's world governing body. The former forward was a member of West Germany's Olympic bronze medal-winning team.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Climate leaders called for solar energy for 'everyone, everywhere' by 2030, but with three years to go, is that goal attainable?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9eee53c207d19f6e38a7c6d9e67c22c23fcd2a39afa7ed3bd61f843b8565fb4c</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T13:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/climate-leaders-called-for-solar-energy-for-everyone-everywhere-by-2030-but-with-three-years-to-go-i/a-79517056--052584d0bcdc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/climate-leaders-called-for-solar-energy-for-everyone-everywhere-by-2030-but-with-three-years-to-go-is-that-goal-attainable/a-79517056?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Prominent climate leaders have called on governments, businesses, institutions and the public to make a push for solar power before the decade is out, repowering the world with cheap, clean energy. Is that possible?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Manchester City Premier League charges: What do they mean?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bc2f4e75352184c06cbe59c81753e6cdbfde354cbfc59359cefe94088e5c1df9</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T11:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/manchester-city-premier-league-charges-what-do-they-mean/a-79485638--5f423a99075f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/manchester-city-premier-league-charges-what-do-they-mean/a-79485638?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Since being bought by the UAE in 2008, Manchester City have become one of the world's most successful football clubs. A raft of serious financial charges threatens to undermine this and bring chaos to the Premier Le