osts while increasing planet-heating emissions.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Germans' biggest fear is the high cost of living, an annual study finds</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fb69a0260329f4a7a0e488d5fb02a17e0600f8496ca752e6a76f79a06b9c88de</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T09:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germans-biggest-fear-is-the-high-cost-of-living-an-annual-study-finds/a-79497762--40495e454721.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germans-biggest-fear-is-the-high-cost-of-living-an-annual-study-finds/a-79497762?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">What do Germans fear most in 2026? Wars? Global crises? Wrong. Their biggest concern is the cost of living, which keeps rising.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Merz lauds NATO with Westphalian Peace Prize</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4c6fe3b6e0aed5e82f60c7fac7d284d78e563857f91325e86a2aaa527ff8e583</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T06:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-lauds-nato-with-westphalian-peace-prize/live-79496180--2a3d5eea8753.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-lauds-nato-with-westphalian-peace-prize/live-79496180?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At a ceremony to honor NATO, the German chancellor warned that Russia will threaten the rest of Europe if it isn't stopped in Ukraine. In other news, the German military will set up its first drone regiment.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>France: Hundreds arrested as student protests escalate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cbe4ae92f1fdd29bb4b3efa712ff5a14873ec31ddcb137d922fed94051437b6c</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T23:02:00Z</published><link rel="alterna